# The bundle's payload is built, never committed: ~8 GB of image tarballs, the
# chart tgzs and the tool binaries. Only the structure and the notes live here,
# so `git clone` stays small and `offline/` is a known place to put the payload
# rather than a directory invented on each site visit.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!versions.env
!site.env.example
!engine-images.txt.example
!*/
!*/.gitkeep
